==========
docker compose
1. Build the images without starting the containers
docker compose build
2. Build and start the containers immediately (Most Common)
docker compose up --build

3. Force a fresh build without using cached layers
docker compose build --no-cache

4. Build a specific service only
docker compose build patient-service



